&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;市川工場と勝田工場を組織統合し、関東工場と称す&lt;/p&gt;
